{
  "title": "Parkin (PRKN) cellular abundance",
  "methodText": "Only the sequencing reads with an exact barcode match were counted. Scores were calculated per barcode and replicate as a simple mean of FACS bin index and averaged firstly for barcodes describing the same amino acid variant and secondly for biological and FACS replicates. Scores were normalized to nonsense and synonymous wild-type variants.",
  "abstractText": "We used the variant abundance by massively parallel sequencing (VAMP-seq) approach to quantify the abundance of Parkin (PRKN) missense variants in cultured human cells",
